  "brief": "Plain two-storey German-immigrant frame farmhouse with a low hipped roof, narrow clapboard siding and a small interior brick chimney, plus a one-storey shed-roofed kitchen lean-to on the left. Few, small 2-over-2 windows, no porch beyond a stoop; set among overgrown windbreak trees at the end of a dirt lane. The HABS example was documented abandoned ahead of a dam; here the family still lives in it but it is tired.",
